From 0ecad2430225ef264b405698163c70c0be6dea03 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 04:10:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] MIDI CCs: 20-23 the channel's track's Stage knobs, 24 its
 sound, 91/93 the shared reverb/chorus

CC 20-23 set the four Stage knobs of the track the channel plays (absolute), not the knobs of the
screen shown. CC 24 steps that track's sound as PRESETS does. CC 91 and 93 set the MIX of the
shared rack's REVERB (else ROOM) and CHORUS (else PEDAL CHORUS). CC 24-27's track levels are gone.
A MIDI Track's channel passes these CCs on.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0131vpfZVN4vprBnQkpmn5yn
